WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.804 --> 00:00:06.358
1. Open the account menu at the top right.

2
00:00:06.358 --> 00:00:11.555
2. Choose العربية. Your account switches to Arabic, right to left.

3
00:00:11.555 --> 00:00:17.304
3. Your choice is remembered on this device.

4
00:00:17.304 --> 00:00:28.785
4. To switch back, open the same menu and choose English.
